      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Jo et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Here, we report the genome sequence of grapevine virus K (GVK), a novel single-stranded RNA virus identified from a transcriptome of grapevine. The genome of GVK is 7,476 nucleotides in length and encodes 5 open reading frames. GVK is a putative member of the genus Vitivirus in the family Betaflexiviridae."
